   "source": [
    "# Assignment 9 – Image Classification using Convolutional Neural Networks (CNN)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Dataset used:** [Dog and Cat Classification Dataset – Kaggle (Bhavik Jikadara)](https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/bhavikjikadara/dog-and-cat-classification-dataset)\n",
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "e821de45",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Task 1: Data Understanding"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "4056a5b2",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
